github.setup        getzola zola 0.23.6 v
github.tarball_from archive
revision            0

homepage            https://www.getzola.org

description         \
    A fast static site generator in a single binary with everything built-in.

long_description    \
    {*}${description} Zola comes as a single executable with Sass \
    compilation, syntax highlighting, table of contents and many other \
    features that traditionally require setting up a dev environment or \
    adding some JavaScript libraries to your site. The average site will be \
    generated in less than a second, including Sass compilation and syntax \
    highlighting.  Zola renders your whole site as static sites, making it \
    trivial to handle any kind of traffic you will throw at it at no cost \
    without having to worry about managing a server or a database. Using \
    augmented Markdown, Zola comes with shortcodes and internal links to \
    make it easier to write your content.

